// GY-BMP280-3.3. Pin order and the four 10 kΩ resistors are the module described at
// https://startingelectronics.org/pinout/GY-BMP280-pressure-sensor-module/ and
// https://domoticx.net/docs/bmp280-information/ : SCL, SDA and CSB pull up to VCC, and SDO
// pulls down to GND, so the I2C address is 0x76 unless SDO is tied high. The module has no
// regulator and no level shifter. It runs from 1.71 V to 3.6 V. The two supply capacitors are
// 100 nF, the value Bosch recommends for C1 and C2; the module diagram shows two capacitors
// and does not print the value.
{
  "format": 1,
