  "title": "GY-BMP280-3.3 pressure module",
  "summary": "BMP280 breakout, 6 pins on 2.54 mm: VCC, GND, SCL, SDA, CSB, SDO. Three 10 kΩ resistors pull SCL, SDA and CSB up to VCC, and one 10 kΩ pulls SDO down, so I2C address 0x76 is the default and CSB stays high. Two 100 nF capacitors sit on VDD and VDDIO. There is no regulator and no level shifter. Power it from 3.3 V. It reads the scene's temperature and pressure.",
